 bonus by {{amount}}, reducing damage & increasing chance to dodge magic attacks."},[MagicMasteryEffect.IncreasedExperienceBy]:{title:"⬆️ Magic Experience",description:"Increases your magic experience gained by {{amount}}%."},[MagicMasteryEffect.IncreasedAttackSpeedBy]:{title:"⬆️ Spell Attack SPEEEEEEEED",description:"Increases your attack speed with spells by {{amount}}%."},[MagicMasteryEffect.ReducedChargeCostBy]:{title:"⬇️ Spell Cost",description:"Reduces the charge cost of all magic spells by {{amount}}%."},[MagicMasteryEffect.SetPassiveTriggerStaffOfElements]:{title:"✨ Staff of Elements",description:"Replaces the free auto-attack passive of all staves with a random Tier-<calc(floor(({{amount}} - 1) / 2))> to Tier-<calc(floor(({{amount}} - 1) / 2) + 1)> elemental spell (Excluding frost)."},[MagicMasteryEffect.PassiveTriggerFrozenChill]:{title:"✨ Frozen Chill",description:"Your magic attacks deal an additional {{amount}}% damage to movement impaired targets."},[MagicMasteryEffect.PassiveEnhancedPower]:{title:"✨ Enhanced Power",description:"Elemental spell effects have up-to {{amount}}% increased trigger chance and effectiveness, scaling based on stress (0% bonus at 0 stress, {{amount}}% bonus at 200 stress). Applies to Frost Nova CC."},[MagicMasteryEffect.AbilityFrostNova]:{title:"⚡ Frost Nova Ability",description:"Freezes all enemies around your character in a 5x5 area for {{amount}} seconds, slowing, rooting and dealing <calc(20 * {{amount}})> magic damage. Cooldown 1 minute."},[MagicMasteryEffect.AbilityMasterMindController]:{title:"⚡ Master Mind Controller Ability",description:"Mind control all NPCs around your character, up-to {{amount}} tiles away for 45s. Attacks your current target or each other. Affects up-to T4 NPCs. Cooldown 5 minutes."},[MagicMasteryEffect.AbilitySheep]:{title:"⚡ Sheep Ability",description:"Turns the enemy into a sheep for 15 seconds and heals them by 200. If the enemy takes any damage, they will revert back to their original form. This ability has a 5 minute cooldown."}},MeleeMasteryEffect={IncreasedDamageBy:"melee_increased_damage_by",IncreasedAccuracyBy:"melee_increased_accuracy_by",IncreasedDefenceBy:"melee_increased_defence_by",IncreasedExperienceBy:"melee_increased_experience_by",IncreasedSpecialAttackEffectivenessBy:"melee_increased_special_attack_effectiveness_by",SetLifeStealAmount:"melee_set_life_steal_amount",SetCriticalHitChance:"melee_set_critical_hit_chance",PassiveTriggerFillSpecialWeaponBar:"melee_passive_trigger_fill_special_weapon_bar",AbilityInstantAttack:"melee_ability_instant_attack",AbilityEvasion:"melee_ability_evasion",AbilityTaunt:"melee_ability_taunt"},MeleeMasteriesDescriptions={[MeleeMasteryEffect.IncreasedDamageBy]:{title:"⬆️ Melee Damage",description:"Increases your melee damage dealt by a flat {{amount}}%."},[MeleeMasteryEffect.IncreasedAccuracyBy]:{title:"⬆️ Melee Accuracy",description:"Increases your melee accuracy bonuses by {{amount}}."},[MeleeMasteryEffect.IncreasedExperienceBy]:{title:"⬆️ Melee Experience",description:"Increases your melee experience gained by {{amount}}%."},[MeleeMasteryEffect.IncreasedSpecialAttackEffectivenessBy]:{title:"⬆️ Special Attack Effectiveness",description:"Increases your melee special attack effectiveness by {{amount}}%. This will increase the damage dealt, accuracy, and other effects of your special attack."},[MeleeMasteryEffect.IncreasedDefenceBy]:{title:"⬆️ Melee Defence",description:"Increases your melee defence bonuses by {{amount}}."},[MeleeMasteryEffect.SetLifeStealAmount]:{title:"✨ Life Steal",description:"Your melee attacks will steal {{amount}}% of the damage dealt as health."},[MeleeMasteryEffect.SetCriticalHitChance]:{title:"✨ Critical Trouble",description:"On successful melee hit, you have a {{amount}}% chance to critically strike the target. Minimum damage is increased by 70 and maximum damage is increased by 30%."},[MeleeMasteryEffect.PassiveTriggerFillSpecialWeaponBar]:{title:"✨ Special Time",description:"Your mel